    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.1.04-02",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A coastal example can number twenty eligible safe stations and draw five distinct numbers without replacement. Record the selected numbers and use the corresponding stations where access permits. If a selected site is unsuitable, follow a stated safe replacement or exclusion procedure and report it. The actual inference concerns the eligible frame. Random selection does not justify unsafe access or guarantee every characteristic is represented in a small sample.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-4.1.04-1",
        "CL-6137-4.1.04-2",
        "CL-6137-4.1.04-01-1",
